abstract: >-
  Numerical and symbolic reproducibility package supporting calculations associated
  with "Fate of a one-particle state approaching the Schwarzschild spacelike singularity"
  and overlapping Kasner fixed-point results reported in
  "Universal Quantum Kasner Fixed Point at the Schwarzschild Singularity".
